{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂1の乃木坂ヲタク\nかりんの発音 上り坂↑\n伊藤かりん↑です(っｴ`o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2016/02/28/6451058/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"B.L.T.発売中です。\nカラフルなお洋服だいすきだから\n着られて幸せ。♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"---------"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"京都握手会ありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全握はさゆりんご軍団レーン！\n写メ真ん中はマネージャーさん！\n軍団員カメラマン マユコではないよ！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2016/02/28/6451058/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この日夜ご飯をメンバー何人かで\n食べに行ったんだけど、\n何も気にせず座ったら\nさゆりんご軍団4人が横並びで\n座っていました(๑°︿°๑)！(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2016/02/28/6451058/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おデコになんで絆創膏貼っているか\n教えてください、軍団長。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"個握も楽しかった～♡"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2016/02/28/6451058/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昔着たことのあるオーバーオール！\n誰も気づいてなかったけどね！(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"トップスはいつものDot&Stripesで\n靴は香港で1500円で買った靴だよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2日間楽しかったです！\nありがとうございました！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"---------"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"質問返し"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2016/02/28/6451058/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎46時間TVのカラオケバトルって候補曲を3曲選んでたらしいけど、かりんは「Everything」以外何選んでたの？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→大原櫻子さんの瞳と\nまひが歌ってた「ひまわりの約束」！\nまひたんとは歌う曲が\nよくかぶるのよ～(๑°︿°๑)！(笑)\nあとは岩崎宏美さんのロマンスも\n最後まで悩んでた(๑°︿°๑)！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎かりんちゃんって実際身長何センチ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→公式では154cmなんだっけ？\n最近測ってないから分からないけど、\n153～154cmの間だと思う！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎かりんちゃんってコメント全部読むようにしてるスタイルですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→そうだよ～！コメント読むのだいすき！\nすぐ読み終わっちゃう！(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"以上！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"---------"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"《告知》"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"-- TV --"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎将棋フォーカス   NHK Eテレ\n毎週日曜 10:00～\n(再)毎週木曜 15:00～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2016/02/28/6451058/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3月6日の放送では\nついに1分切れ負け将棋で\nMC対決、山崎八段vs中村六段です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぜひご覧ください～～(^o^)！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"-- 雑誌/新聞 --"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎BRODY vol.4 発売中\n◎B.L.T. 4月号 発売中"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎BUBKA 4月号 2月29日発売"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2016/02/28/6451058/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆりんご軍団特集やああああ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎将棋世界 4月号 3月3日発売"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、タイトルは\n病んでるわけではないです。(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"不等号の私のパート♡\nのぎのの聞いてくれましたかね？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"か  り  ん  (っｴ`o)"}],"source":"archive"}